  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility of seed potato storage investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the feasibility study is to ascertain the commercial and technical viability of the cold storage solution of Hanse Agro for the seed potato business of the interested local partner. The cold storage will allow the local client to double their current production of seed potatoes, creating an additional 80 permanent jobs and an additional 60-70 jobs during peak production periods. The cold storage project will also increase local knowledge on cold storage systems management, operation of solar pv systems and equipment maintenance. The cold storage will also increase access for local farmers to high quality seed potatoes, increasing their yields.</narrative>
  </description>
